 "summary": "Nine single Schottky rectifiers in the DO-214AC (SMA) surface-mount package, all rated 1.0 A average forward current and 25 A surge. The types step reverse voltage from 20 V (SS12) to 200 V (SS1200); forward drop at 1 A rises with the voltage class from 0.55 V to 0.9 V maximum while leakage and capacitance fall. SS14 is the 40 V type: 0.55 V maximum at 1 A, 0.3 mA maximum leakage at 25 °C and 110 pF typical capacitance.",
